  "remarks": "Passport no: a) Kuwait 03111298  b) Kuwait 003111298, issued in Kuwait on 16 September 2010, expired 15 September 2020 in the name of Shafi S M S Alajmi, Arabic script شافي سلطان محمد سلطان العجم c) 0216155930\n\nNational identification no: Kuwait 273010101204\n\nFundraiser for Al-Nusrah Front for the People of the Levant (QDe.137). In November 2023, he was released from prison in Kuwait as part of the Special Amiri Decree Pardon No. 225/2023. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2368 (2017) was concluded on 24 November 2020.; Listing: UN Reference Number: QDi.338\n\nListed on 23 Sep. 2014 (amended on 24 Nov. 2020, 22 August 2025, 13 Aug. 2026)",
